{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:914f9b6614bf4838","name":"Jedi Talent Trees","source":{"id":"source:reference-914f9b6614bf4838","title":"Jedi Talent Trees","revision":18306,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:56:08Z","sha256":"0f2d645df52be8be0d19685e8d5a76f2ee80adfa50f80b72163bcafdcc8565bd","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18306","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Jedi%20Talent%20Trees&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-914f9b6614bf4838","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["At every odd-numbered level (1st, 3rd, 5th, and so on), a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," gains an additional Jedi Talent. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," may choose a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," from any of the following Jedi Talent Trees they wish (or any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Talent_Tree"}," if they have the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Sensitivity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Sensitivity","referenceId":"reference:5202cab02f367bcf"}," feat), but they must meet the prerequisites (if any) of the chosen Jedi Talent. No ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," can be selected more than once unless expressly indicated.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talent Trees"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TALENT TREE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DESCRIPTION\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Consular Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Consular_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:2d5d4eaa526628c0"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," that follow the path of the consular are skilled ambassadors. You prefer to use the strength of your words and the wisdom that ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," provides to solve problems.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Guardian Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Guardian_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:addde71bad5e6ba8"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Jedi that follow the path of the guardian are more combat-oriented than other Jedi, honing their skills to become deadly combatants.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Sentinel Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Sentinel_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:39bae85f284ce360"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," that follow the path of the Sentinel are the true enemies of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"},", hunting down evil and stopping the spread of darkness wherever they go. You are a master of subtlety and difficult to tempt with ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"},", even when constantly confronted by its power.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Combat Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Combat_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:11614943ef3f899e"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," is the chosen weapon of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"},". Not as clumsy or random as a blaster, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," is an elegant weapon for a more civilized combatant. The following talents allow you to improve your prowess with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},".\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
